OL,3,GNEWSAIs an industrial revolution taking
OL,4,Aplace in London?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the late 1700s until the mid 20th
OL,7,FCentury, London was an industrial
OL,8,Fpowerhouse.
OL,10,FBritish-made goods dominated world
OL,11,Ftrade: factories making clothing and
OL,12,Ffurniture coughed out smoke and created
OL,13,Fthe infamous London 'pea-soup' smog.
OL,15,FBy the 1950s, London was at the heart
OL,16,Fof car manufacturing, with Ford in
OL,17,FDagenham employing 40,000 people at its
OL,18,Fsprawling plant in the East End.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
